<div class="container">

<header>
  <h1>Poha Shack — Pricing Decision Analysis</h1>
  <div class="sub">Dine-in orders only · 4 Mar – 12 Sep 2026 · 192 days · Swaroop Nagar, Kanpur · Excl. bulk order #8485 (160× Desi Indori Poha, ₹8,000)</div>
</header>

