      <p style="font-size:11px;color:#8E8B82;margin-top:8px">Two peaks: morning rush (8–11 AM) and late evening (10 PM – 1 AM). Afternoon (2–5 PM) is the dead zone — opportunity for afternoon specials or combos.</p>
